@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@idempotencyKey = demo-idempotency-key-001
@imageUrl = https://picsum.photos/seed/realteeth-demo/512/512.jpg
@conflictImageUrl = https://picsum.photos/seed/realteeth-conflict/512/512.jpg

### 1. 새 작업 생성 -> 202 Accepted, status=PENDING 예상
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}

{
  "imageUrl": "{{imageUrl}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("jobId", response.body.jobId);
%}

### 2. 같은 멱등키 + 같은 payload -> 200 OK, 같은 jobId 예상
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}

{
  "imageUrl": "{{imageUrl}}"
}

### 3. 같은 멱등키 + 다른 payload -> 409 Conflict 예상
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}

{
  "imageUrl": "{{conflictImageUrl}}"
}

### 4. 작업 단건 조회
### scheduler가 이미 처리했다면 status는 PENDING 대신 PROCESSING/COMPLETED/FAILED 일 수 있음
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. 작업 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs?page=0&size=20
Accept: application/json

### 6. 상태별 작업 목록 조회
### 생성 직후 바로 확인하면 PENDING 필터가 더 재현하기 쉬움
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs?page=0&size=20&status=PENDING
Accept: application/json

### 7. 처리 진행 후 상태별 작업 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs?page=0&size=20&status=PROCESSING
Accept: application/json
